  "limitations": [
    "Two-car study assembly (one head car plus intermediate car), not a complete operational consist.",
    "53.56 m is the combined body-shell x extent including the 0.65 m teaching inter-car gap. It is not the entire GLB bounding length or a verified coupler-to-coupler consist length.",
    "4.05 m means rail top to body-shell roof. Body-shell mesh z thickness and raised pantograph height are different values.",
    "Nose/control sections and door/window locations are photo-fitted; body family references include original-head AF-A/AF-B. Not manufacturer Class-A CAD.",
    "Wheel diameter, bogie wheelbase/centre spacing, underfloor equipment, pantograph, seats and mechanical details are teaching assumptions. No vehicle engineering, dynamics, collision, gauge-envelope or manufacturing approval.",
    "GLB has no animation clips or rig. Rotation, exploded display and isolation are viewer interactions, not authored mechanical motion.",
    "Environment and offline renderer lighting/shader graphs are not all preserved in glTF; self-contained loading does not promise matching Cycles images.",
    "Functional category roots do not form complete per-car assemblies. Moving body-shell C1/C2 nodes alone leaves bogies/devices behind."
  ]
